    {
      "id": "claim_7d43699527624e6ba2cfd1e65ee86d29",
      "statement": "Error normalization is deliberately small: Error instances stringify with stacks added as errorStack, plain objects contribute only an own string message property, there is no cause traversal or arbitrary property copying, and field precedence is call details over logger defaults over ambient context with component always fixed.",
