      "statement": "createObservabilityContext gives a package an isolated typed ambient context over AsyncLocalStorage whose createLogger folds it into every log line and whose with() re-establishes it per operation; context does not cross RPC, hibernation, or restart and requires nodejs_als/nodejs_compat; the workshop backend declares its entire field vocabulary (chatId, gadgetId, gatekeeperId, vendorId, toolName, outcome, ...) in one module.",
