      "id": "claim_9a2f590002724ba387a15bfb7ea62103",
      "statement": "reportIssue(failureSite, caught, options) dispatches a bounded failure to the optional private ERROR_REPORTER service binding and is a no-op when the binding is absent (local dev / no issue destination); it reads ambient env/waitUntil from cloudflare:workers so one line reports from any Worker, DO method, or alarm, delivery holds in both stateless Workers and DOs (in-flight RPC keeps the object alive), failures are logged at debug rather than swallowed, and reporting must never disturb the caller.",
