      "statement": "Reports are rate limited by a privacy-preserving key — the verified CF Access sub or a hashed email when Access is configured, else cf-connecting-ip — with a limiter failure degrading to dropping the report; the body is read bounded at 128 KiB and normalized through @gadgets/error-reporting's tolerant contract before forwarding with waitUntil.",
